# Configurable operations beside navigation; object handling lives in Inspector.
# Fresh profile, local mere URL, no network fixture. Restore with the twin scenario.
settle 30
key escape
open mere://pane-migration
settle 10
act Open Gloss pane
settle 10
assert pane gloss
assert text Downloads
capture 01_gloss_downloads_default
act Gloss: remove section — Downloads
settle 5
assert event pane-section-removed downloads
act Gloss: add section — Recent
settle 5
act Gloss: add section — Downloads
settle 5
act Gloss: move section up — Downloads
settle 5
assert event pane-section-moved downloads
assert text Recent
act Open Inspector pane
settle 10
assert pane inspector
assert row URL: mere://pane-migration
click-row genet.reader
settle 10
assert event viewer-changed
assert row Viewer: genet.reader
assert text Document controls
capture 02_inspector_handling
act Save session
settle 10
log Gloss and Inspector migration complete
